@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

###############################################################################
### 1. AUTENTICAÇÃO E USUÁRIOS
###############################################################################

### 1.1 Criar Usuário (Público)
# @name createUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Luiz Silva",
  "phone": "5511999998888",
  "email": "luiz.silva@exemplo.com"
}

### Extrai dinamicamente o ID e Telefone do usuário recém-criado
@userId = {{createUser.response.body.id}}
@userPhone = {{createUser.response.body.phone}}

### 1.2 Login com Telefone (Gera JWT Token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "5511999998888"
}

### Extrai o token de autenticação JWT da resposta de login
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 1.3 Listar Todos os Usuários (Protegido por JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 1.4 Buscar Usuário por ID (Protegido por JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?id={{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 1.5 Buscar Usuário por Telefone (Protegido por JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?phone=5511999998888
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 1.6 Atualizar Dados do Usuário (Protegido por JWT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{userId}}",
  "name": "Luiz Silva Atualizado",
  "phone": "5511999998888",
  "email": "luiz.novo@exemplo.com"
}

###############################################################################
### 2. TRANSAÇÕES FINANCEIRAS (BUDGETING)
###############################################################################

### 2.1 Criar Transação Manualmente (Valor em centavos: 15450 = R$ 154,50)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Supermercado Pão de Açúcar",
  "category": "GROCERIES",
  "amount": 15450
}

### 2.2 Criar Outra Transação (Categoria FARMA: 8990 = R$ 89,90)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Remédios na Farmácia Raia",
  "category": "FARMA",
  "amount": 8990
}

### 2.3 Criar Transação Categoria AUTO (6000 = R$ 60,00)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Gasolina Posto Shell",
  "category": "AUTO",
  "amount": 6000
}

### 2.4 Listar Transações por Categoria (GROCERIES)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/transactions/GROCERIES
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 2.5 Listar Transações por Categoria (FARMA)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/transactions/FARMA
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 2.6 Listar Transações por Categoria (AUTO)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/transactions/AUTO
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###############################################################################
### 3. ASSISTENTE INTELIGENTE COM SPRING AI (TOOL CALLING & ÁUDIO)
###############################################################################

### 3.1 Registrar Transação ou Consultar via Áudio Multimodal (Whisper -> IA Tool -> TTS)
# O modelo Whisper transcreve o áudio, a IA analisa a intenção, chama a Tool correspondente
# (persist-transaction ou list-transaction-by-category) e responde em áudio sintetizado (.wav)!
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/transactions/ai
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="audio_transacao.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./sample_audio.wav
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###############################################################################
### 4. ENDPOINTS AUXILIARES DE IA (SPEECH & CHAT)
###############################################################################

### 4.1 Sintetizar Texto em Áudio (TTS - Text to Speech)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/synthesize
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Olá Luiz! Sua despesa de cinquenta reais no supermercado foi registrada com sucesso."
}

### 4.2 Transcrever Arquivo de Áudio Direto (STT - Speech to Text)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transcription
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="audio_teste.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./sample_audio.wav
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 4.3 Chat Model Direto
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat-model?prompt=Explique em uma frase o conceito de Clean Architecture.
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4.4 Chat Client com Fluent API
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat-client?prompt=Me dê 3 dicas práticas para controle de orçamento pessoal.
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###############################################################################
### 5. DOCUMENTAÇÃO SWAGGER / OPENAPI
###############################################################################

### 5.1 Obter OpenAPI JSON Specification (Público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/api-docs

### 5.2 Acessar Swagger UI no Navegador:
# http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html

###############################################################################
### 6. LIMPEZA / DELEÇÃO DE USUÁRIO
###############################################################################

### 6.1 Deletar Usuário Criado (Protegido por JWT)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users?id={{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
